PaymentRails_ReturnNative
├── when caller is not the module configured for the source token
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_UnexpectedNativeDepositor
├── when the source token has no configuration
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_UnexpectedNativeDepositor
├── when value is zero
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_ZeroAmount
├── when the configured module returns value
│   ├── it should increase the native balance by the value
│   ├── it should emit NativeReturned with source token, module and value
│   └── it should not emit NativeReceived
└── fuzz
    └── when any non-zero value is returned
        └── it should hold exactly the value
